# Spark/Hive driver-side detritus (Derby fallback metastore + warehouse)
metastore_db/
spark-warehouse/

# graphify generated artifacts — the whole dir is regenerated by code-only
# rebuild (git hook / `/graphify`), so ignore it wholesale rather than listing
# files: newer graphifyy versions keep adding artifacts (manifest.json,
# .graphify_labels.json, .graphify_root, …) that a per-file list silently
# misses. Untracked so rebuild churn can't dirty the tree and block
# checkout/merge. If absent, regenerate locally (graphify in .venv [dev] extra).
graphify-out/

# Claude Code session artifacts
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.superpowers/

# 手冊審稿 subagent 即時日誌（審稿過程鷹架，非手冊產品，不入版控）
docs/handbooks/spark-tuning/.reviews/

# 專利簡報（Slidev）與 slidev skill — 刻意與 recsys_tfb 分離，不一起入版控。
# presentation/ 含原始截圖、slides.md 與 Slidev 專案（node_modules 等）。
# .agents/、.claude/skills/ 是 `skills add slidevjs/slidev` 裝進來的 skill 本體與符號連結。
# 註：.claude/settings.json 仍為已追蹤的專案設定，不受影響（此處只忽略 .claude/skills/）。
# skills-lock.json 一併忽略：skill 本體既然不在 repo 裡，單獨留一份 lockfile 只會讓
# 下一個人以為 `skills add` 是這個 repo 的一部分。
presentation/
.agents/
.claude/skills/
skills-lock.json